Initially proposed (as __xe'e__) by ((John Clifford)) (as an interpretation of ((Jorge Llambias))' __xe'e__ (((xe'e1))): [http://balance.wiw.org/~jkominek/lojban/9411/msg00214.html

Renamed] by ((Jorge Llambias)) to __xa'a__. ((And Rosta)) then suggested __xa'anai__ take over from (his own) ((xo'o)): [http://balance.wiw.org/~jkominek/lojban/9411/msg00239.html

Renamed] by ((And Rosta)) to __xo'u__ to avoid clash with ((Gerald Koenig))'s ((xa'a)): [http://balance.wiw.org/~jkominek/lojban/9412/msg00407.html

Threads] on mailing list archives involving this cmavo:

